---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Manifesto — Stack10"
  description="We replaced the era of advisory with execution and validation. This is what we believe, and why it changes everything."
  canonicalUrl="https://stack10.ai/manifesto/"
>

  <!-- ── HERO ──────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <section class="m-hero" style="background: var(--gray-1000); color: var(--gray-0);">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="badge m-hero-badge">Our Manifesto</span>
      <h1 class="m-hero-title">The End of Traditional Consulting.</h1>
      <p class="m-hero-sub">In 1926, McKinsey invented traditional management consulting. In 2025, Stack10 is reinventing it.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── BODY ──────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <div class="container cs-body">

    <!-- ── The Problem ───────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <section class="cs-section" data-reveal>
      <span class="overline m-label">The Problem</span>
      <h2 class="cs-section-title">The traditional consulting model is broken.</h2>
      <p class="p1">Legacy consulting firms have monetised complexity. For too long, they have sold theoretical roadmaps, static 200-page decks, and multi-year "Digital Transformations" designed to maximise billable hours, not business value.</p>
      <p class="p2">The result? Billions of dollars spent on strategy, yet recommended initiatives fail to be implemented because they are disconnected from operational and technical reality.</p>
      <p class="p2">Worse still: when AI solutions are built on broken processes, they simply automate dysfunction at scale.</p>
      <p class="p2">We founded Stack10 to replace the era of Advisory with Execution and Validation. In the age of AI, transformation must be measured in working code deployed on optimised processes — not slides presented. Why deliver a slide deck when you can deliver a working prototype running on proven, data-driven processes?</p>
    </section>

    <div class="cs-divider" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <!-- ── Our Approach ───────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <section class="cs-section" data-reveal>
      <span class="overline m-label">Our Approach</span>
      <h2 class="cs-section-title">We close the gap between strategy, execution, and sustained value realisation.</h2>
      <p class="p2">We provide 30, 60, or 90-day programmes that surface high-impact AI use cases, build them on solid process foundations, quantify ROI with data, and ensure continuous optimisation. Here is how we execute.</p>

      <div class="m-stages">

        <!-- Stage 1 -->
        <div class="card m-stage" data-reveal>
          <div class="m-stage-header">
            <span class="m-stage-num">Stage 1</span>
            <h3 class="m-stage-title">Identify the Opportunity</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="p2">We conduct a deep analysis of your operations to map your business processes and uncover hidden inefficiencies that drive immediate commercial impact.</p>
          <p class="p2">We conduct operational and technical assessments to surface high-value AI use cases across your organisation. We deploy process mining to reveal how work actually flows through your systems today — not how you think it flows, but what the data proves is happening. We build process baseline metrics to compare your organisation's performance against industry standards. This eliminates guesswork and ensures AI solutions are built on process reality, not assumptions.</p>
          <div class="m-deliverable">
            <span class="m-deliverable-label">Deliverable</span>
            <p class="p2">AI opportunity register mapped to data-proven process inefficiencies, with ROI projections grounded in actual operational behaviour.</p>
          </div>
          <p class="m-why"><strong>Why this matters:</strong> Building AI on unvalidated process assumptions is like building a house on sand. We establish the bedrock first.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Stage 2 -->
        <div class="card m-stage" data-reveal>
          <div class="m-stage-header">
            <span class="m-stage-num">Stage 2</span>
            <h3 class="m-stage-title">Architect the Solution</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="p2">We architect strict, ROI-based AI solutions tailored directly to the opportunities identified in Stage 1. We convert findings into a precise engineering roadmap and backlog ready for execution.</p>
          <div class="m-deliverable">
            <span class="m-deliverable-label">Deliverable</span>
            <p class="p2">Technical architecture, solution design, and development backlog with clear success metrics tied to process improvements.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Stage 3 -->
        <div class="card m-stage" data-reveal>
          <div class="m-stage-header">
            <span class="m-stage-num">Stage 3</span>
            <h3 class="m-stage-title">Execute the Roadmap</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="p2">We turn your AI strategy and roadmap into reality. We drive the execution, handling the full transformation across your people, processes, and technology.</p>
          <div class="m-deliverable">
            <span class="m-deliverable-label">Deliverable</span>
            <p class="p2">Working AI solutions deployed in production, integrated with your existing systems, and adopted by your teams.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Stage 4 -->
        <div class="card m-stage" data-reveal>
          <div class="m-stage-header">
            <span class="m-stage-num">Stage 4</span>
            <h3 class="m-stage-title">Validate &amp; Measure</h3>
          </div>
          <span class="badge badge-secondary m-stage-badge">Peace of mind — a competitive advantage vs. traditional consulting</span>

          <div class="m-sub">
            <p class="m-sub-label">The Challenge</p>
            <p class="p2">Most AI transformations fail not at implementation, but at adoption and realisation. Organisations deploy AI solutions that either don't get used, get worked around, or create unintended consequences elsewhere in the process chain.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="m-sub">
            <p class="m-sub-label">The Solution</p>
            <p class="p2">We deploy process mining to realise the value of your newly implemented AI's impact:</p>
            <ul class="m-list">
              <li><strong>Adoption Monitoring:</strong> We track whether the AI solution is being used as intended or if staff are finding workarounds.</li>
              <li><strong>Impact Quantification:</strong> We measure actual time savings, cost reductions, and efficiency gains against promised ROI — with data, not anecdotes.</li>
              <li><strong>Unintended Consequence Detection:</strong> We identify if the AI optimisation has created new bottlenecks, compliance risks, or quality issues elsewhere in your processes.</li>
              <li><strong>ROI Validation:</strong> We prove whether the AI is delivering the business value promised in Stage 1, using the same process mining methodology that established the baseline.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="m-deliverable">
            <span class="m-deliverable-label">Deliverable</span>
            <p class="p2">Live process mining dashboard showing real-time AI performance metrics, adoption rates, and validated ROI — updated continuously, not quarterly.</p>
          </div>
          <p class="m-why"><strong>Why this matters:</strong> Without objective measurement, you're trusting hope instead of data. We prove your AI investment is working.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Stage 5 -->
        <div class="card m-stage" data-reveal>
          <div class="m-stage-header">
            <span class="m-stage-num">Stage 5</span>
            <h3 class="m-stage-title">Optimise &amp; Scale</h3>
          </div>

          <div class="m-sub">
            <p class="m-sub-label">The Challenge</p>
            <p class="p2">AI performance degrades over time as business conditions change. What worked brilliantly in month one may be sub-optimal by month six. Without continuous monitoring, you won't know until it's too late.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="m-sub">
            <p class="m-sub-label">The Solution</p>
            <p class="p2">We establish a continuous process intelligence capability that ensures your AI investments keep delivering:</p>
            <ul class="m-list">
              <li><strong>Performance Benchmarking:</strong> Ongoing comparison of AI-enhanced processes against baseline to track degradation or improvement trends.</li>
              <li><strong>Variant Analysis:</strong> Identification of process deviations and exceptions that indicate where AI needs retraining or reconfiguration.</li>
              <li><strong>Scaling Playbook:</strong> Data-driven identification of where successful AI implementations should be replicated across departments, regions, or processes for additional value.</li>
              <li><strong>ROI Protection:</strong> Early warning system for when AI performance drops, triggering investigation before business impact occurs.</li>
              <li><strong>Optimisation Pipeline:</strong> Systematic identification of next-phase improvements based on actual process behaviour rather than assumptions.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="m-deliverable">
            <span class="m-deliverable-label">Deliverable</span>
            <p class="p2">Embedded process intelligence capability within your organisation, complete with trained personnel, ongoing monitoring dashboards, and quarterly optimisation recommendations backed by data.</p>
          </div>
          <p class="m-why"><strong>Why this matters:</strong> AI transformation isn't a project, it's a capability. We ensure your competitive advantage compounds over time rather than erodes.</p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="cs-divider" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <!-- ── Our Commitment ─────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <section class="cs-section" data-reveal>
      <span class="overline m-label">Our Commitment</span>
      <h2 class="cs-section-title">To replace the legacy model, we remove the friction that makes it slow and expensive.</h2>
      <p class="p2">We align our success entirely with yours. When you partner with Stack10, we make three promises.</p>

      <div class="m-commitments">

        <div class="card m-commitment" data-reveal>
          <div class="m-commitment-header">
            <span class="m-commitment-num">1</span>
            <h3 class="m-commitment-heading">Aligned Incentives</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="p2">Legacy firms profit from long, drawn-out projects. We profit from efficiency and validated outcomes. Stack10 charges for the output delivered, not the hours worked. We measure success by milestones and proven ROI, not reports produced. If our approach delivers results faster, we all benefit.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card m-commitment" data-reveal>
          <div class="m-commitment-header">
            <span class="m-commitment-num">2</span>
            <h3 class="m-commitment-heading">Elite Builders and Analysts</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="p2">We place top-tier technical talent and process specialists directly into your organisation. We reject the traditional model where a Partner sells the project and a junior implements it. You get the best minds building and validating your future.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card m-commitment" data-reveal>
          <div class="m-commitment-header">
            <span class="m-commitment-num">3</span>
            <h3 class="m-commitment-heading">Success in Execution and Realisation</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="p2">We measure our success by AI solutions successfully running in your business, fully adopted by your team, and delivering measurable ROI validated through continuous process intelligence. Not promised impact — proven impact.</p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="cs-divider" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <!-- ── What Stack10 delivers ──────────────────────────────── -->
    <section class="cs-section" data-reveal>
      <span class="overline m-label">What Stack10 delivers</span>
      <h2 class="cs-section-title">Traditional consulting gives you a strategy. We give you results.</h2>

      <div class="m-delivers">
        <div class="card m-deliver" data-reveal>
          <p class="m-deliver-text">Working AI solutions built on process reality</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card m-deliver" data-reveal>
          <p class="m-deliver-text">Data-proven ROI, not consultant promises</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card m-deliver" data-reveal>
          <p class="m-deliver-text">Continuous optimisation that protects your investment</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card m-deliver" data-reveal>
          <p class="m-deliver-text">A capability that compounds competitive advantage over time</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="cs-divider" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <!-- ── Closing ────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <section class="cs-section m-closing" data-reveal>
      <p class="p1">The firms billing you for strategy are not invested in your outcome. They are invested in the next engagement. We built Stack10 because enterprises deserve partners who write code, not reports — who measure ROI in production systems, not PowerPoint slides. That is the only version of AI transformation we know how to deliver.</p>
      <p class="m-closing-question">Ready to see what this looks like in practice?</p>
      <div class="m-closing-cta">
        <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Get Started</a>
      </div>
    </section>

  </div>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
  /* ── Hero ────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .m-hero {
    padding: var(--space-20) 0 var(--space-16);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--gray-800);
  }

  .m-hero-badge {
    background: transparent;
    border-color: var(--gray-700);
    color: var(--gray-300);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-6);
    display: inline-flex;
  }

  .m-hero-title {
    font-size: var(--size-5xl);
    font-weight: var(--weight-800);
    line-height: 1.1;
    color: var(--gray-0);
    max-width: 56rem;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-6);
  }

  .m-hero-sub {
    font-size: var(--size-xl);
    font-weight: var(--weight-500);
    color: var(--gray-400);
    max-width: 44rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  /* ── Body layout (mirrors cs-body from case study) ───────────── */
  .cs-body {
    padding-top: var(--space-16);
    padding-bottom: var(--space-16);
    max-width: 68rem;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  .cs-section {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }

  .cs-section-title {
    font-size: var(--size-2xl);
    font-weight: var(--weight-700);
    color: var(--foreground);
    line-height: 1.25;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-6);
  }

  .cs-section .p1 {
    font-size: var(--size-lg);
    color: var(--foreground);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-5);
  }

  .cs-section .p2 {
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }

  .cs-divider {
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--border);
    margin: var(--space-12) 0;
  }

  /* ── Section labels ──────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .m-label {
    display: block;
    color: var(--primary);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }

  /* ── Stages ──────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .m-stages {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    margin-top: var(--space-8);
  }

  .m-stage {
    padding: var(--space-7) var(--space-8);
  }

  .m-stage-header {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-5);
  }

  .m-stage-num {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--size-xs);
    font-weight: var(--weight-700);
    color: var(--primary);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
  }

  .m-stage-title {
    font-size: var(--size-xl);
    font-weight: var(--weight-700);
    color: var(--foreground);
    line-height: 1.3;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .m-stage-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-5);
    margin-top: calc(var(--space-3) * -1);
  }

  .m-stage .p2 {
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }

  /* Sub-sections (Challenge / Solution) */
  .m-sub {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-5);
    padding-top: var(--space-4);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .m-sub-label {
    font-size: var(--size-xs);
    font-weight: var(--weight-700);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }

  .m-sub .p2 {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }

  /* Bullet list */
  .m-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: var(--space-3) 0 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-3);
  }

  .m-list li {
    font-size: var(--size-base);
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
    line-height: 1.7;
    padding-left: var(--space-5);
    position: relative;
  }

  .m-list li::before {
    content: "—";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--primary);
    font-weight: var(--weight-700);
  }

  /* Deliverable callout */
  .m-deliverable {
    border-left: 3px solid var(--primary);
    padding: var(--space-4) var(--space-6);
    background: var(--card);
    border-radius: 0 var(--radius-4) var(--radius-4) 0;
    margin: var(--space-5) 0 var(--space-4);
  }

  .m-deliverable-label {
    display: block;
    font-size: var(--size-xs);
    font-weight: var(--weight-700);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--primary);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
  }

  .m-deliverable .p2 {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--foreground);
    font-weight: var(--weight-500);
  }

  /* Why this matters */
  .m-why {
    font-size: var(--size-sm);
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
    padding-top: var(--space-3);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .m-why strong {
    color: var(--foreground);
  }

  /* ── Commitments ─────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .m-commitments {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    margin-top: var(--space-8);
  }

  .m-commitment {
    padding: var(--space-6) var(--space-8);
  }

  .m-commitment-header {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 2.5rem 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    align-items: start;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }

  .m-commitment-num {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--size-2xl);
    font-weight: var(--weight-800);
    color: var(--primary);
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .m-commitment-heading {
    font-size: var(--size-xl);
    font-weight: var(--weight-700);
    color: var(--foreground);
    line-height: 1.3;
    margin: 0;
    padding-top: var(--space-1);
  }

  .m-commitment .p2 {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
    line-height: 1.7;
    padding-left: calc(2.5rem + var(--space-4));
  }

  /* ── Deliverables grid ───────────────────────────────────────── */
  .m-delivers {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    margin-top: var(--space-8);
  }

  .m-deliver {
    padding: var(--space-6) var(--space-7);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .m-deliver-text {
    font-size: var(--size-lg);
    font-weight: var(--weight-600);
    color: var(--foreground);
    line-height: 1.4;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* ── Closing ─────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .m-closing .p1 {
    font-size: var(--size-lg);
    color: var(--foreground);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-5);
    max-width: 56rem;
  }

  .m-closing-question {
    font-size: var(--size-2xl);
    font-weight: var(--weight-700);
    color: var(--foreground);
    line-height: 1.3;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .m-closing-cta {
    margin-top: var(--space-8);
  }

  /* ── Responsive ──────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .m-hero {
      padding: var(--space-16) 0 var(--space-12);
    }

    .m-hero-title {
      font-size: var(--size-3xl);
    }

    .m-hero-sub {
      font-size: var(--size-base);
    }

    .m-stage {
      padding: var(--space-6) var(--space-5);
    }

    .m-commitment {
      padding: var(--space-6) var(--space-5);
    }

    .m-commitment .p2 {
      padding-left: 0;
    }

    .m-delivers {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .m-closing-question {
      font-size: var(--size-xl);
    }
  }
</style>
